  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Loading Message**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the `App.tsx` file and identified two instances of the loading message string, at lines 51 and 110. I need to update these instances.\n\n\n**Refining Branding Elements**\n\nI\'m now diving into the branding. I\'ve cross-referenced the user request with metadata.json, index.html, OuterFrame.tsx, and NewTab.tsx to ensure consistent naming and descriptions. I\'m focusing on updating the header from \"Flash-Lite Browser\" to reflect the \"AgentSamRemix Browser\" theme.\n\n\n**Designing Text-to-Speech**\n\nI\'m deep in the design phase for the text-to-speech service. I\'m building a dedicated hook to manage speech synthesis comprehensively. I need to ensure it gracefully handles the `window.speechSynthesis` API, cleans text from HTML by removing scripts, styles, SVGs and empty lines, and separates blocks correctly for natural pauses. Chunking long text for smooth playback is also critical. I\'m focusing on defining clear states for speaking status, pause status, rate, voice selection, and available voices for a streamlined user experience.\n\n\n**Defining TTS Utilities**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the utility functions for text-to-speech. I\'m considering `utils/textExtractor.ts`, `utils/ttsHelpers.ts`, or integrating it within the `hooks/useSpeechSynthesis.ts` hook. I need to ensure a robust text extraction approach from HTML, especially removing non-content elements. I also need to insert appropriate spacing and punctuation after block-level elements for natural pauses.\n\n\n**Refining Sentence Extraction**\n\nI\'m now refining the sentence extraction logic. I\'ve updated the punctuation insertion to add a period with spacing to elements, unless the text already ends with a sentence terminator. I\'m focusing on text normalization to handle excessive spaces and improve readability. For the chunking logic, I\'m testing `splitTextIntoChunks`, specifically splitting text into manageable segments based on sentence boundaries, considering a maximum chunk length.\n\n\n**Implementing Chunking Logic**\n\nI\'m now implementing the text chunking functionality within my custom hook. I\'m focusing on `splitTextIntoChunks`, specifically handling cases where sentences exceed the maximum chunk length. I am prioritizing a comma-based split or falling back to word-level splits to ensure manageable segments. I\'m also addressing edge cases and refining the logic for pushing chunks.\n\n\n**Implementing Speech Synthesis**\n\nI\'m now implementing the core speech synthesis logic within the hook. I\'ve set up references for crucial states like chunk index, speaking status, and playback rate. I\'m focusing on handling the `window.speechSynthesis` API, including voice loading and selection, and syncing refs for dynamic updates. I\'ve implemented a `speakNextChunk` function using `SpeechSynthesisUtterance` to manage chunk playback, ensuring proper sequencing and error handling, including cancellation events.\n\n\n**Implementing Pause/Resume**\n\nI\'m now integrating pause and resume functionalities. I\'ve implemented `stop`, `pause`, and `resume` functions within my custom hook, and added the `togglePlayPause` to be a wrapper function that provides the main functionality for the text-to-speech. I\'m focusing on ensuring proper state updates and interactions with the `window.speechSynthesis` API, including ref syncing. I\'m prioritizing edge case handling and seamless user experience.\n\n\n"
