  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Environment View**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the interactive `/components/AgentSamEnvironment.tsx` component. The initial design includes an \"Environment State Header\". I\'m structuring it to display a status badge (PROVISIONING, RUNNING, etc.). There will also be a target backend selector, allowing the user to switch between options like Google Antigravity, Cloudflare Containers, Local Mac, or GCP VM, alongside a spec preview.\n\n\n**Developing Feature Set**\n\nI\'ve progressed to integrating the network policy inspector, visualizing the container lifecycle, and a live firewall display. This now includes domain statuses like \"ALLOWED - PyPI CDN\" and \"UNAUTHORIZED IP BLOCKED\". Next, I\'m focusing on the execution stream, aiming to create structured thought blocks with expandable reasoning and interactive terminal blocks.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
