    response: "I have integrated and completed the **AgentSam AntiGravity Execution Lane** within **AgentSamRemix Browser**:\n\n### What Was Built & Integrated:\n- **AntiGravity Sandbox & Mission Runner**:\n  - **Live Autonomous Stream**: Simulates and displays step-by-step agent thoughts with real terminal command executions, standard output logs, git diffs, and live status tags.\n  - **Click-to-Expand Accordion**: Easily collapse or expand any execution step to inspect the underlying model reasoning and terminal commands.\n  - **Network Egress Allowlist Inspector**: Dedicated table demonstrating allowlisted domains (such as PyPI\'s CDN `files.pythonhosted.org`, GitHub, and Google APIs) vs. unauthorized network endpoints with egress telemetry.\n  - **Mission Presets**: Includes the preset for *\"Audit this repository for competing identity authorities\"* as well as network allowlist verification and benchmarking missions.\n  - **Cost & Telemetry Benchmarker**: Side-by-side spec comparison between **Cloudflare Containers** (1/4 vCPU, 1 GiB RAM, sovereign baseline) and **Google Antigravity** (free remote sandbox compute during preview with Gemini 3.7 Flash token pricing breakdown).\n  - **System Architecture Visualizer**: Vector diagram mapping the Agent Gateway, Cloudflare Worker DO proxy, and execution engines.\n\n- **Seamless View Switcher**:\n  - Top header toggle to easily jump between **Browser Mode** (generative web browsing with native Text-to-Speech) and **AntiGravity Lane**.\n  - Direct quick-launch action buttons in both the Address Bar menu and the New Tab screen."
    modified_response: "I have integrated and completed the **AgentSam AntiGravity Execution Lane** within **AgentSamRemix Browser**:\n\n### What Was Built & Integrated:\n- **AntiGravity Sandbox & Mission Runner**:\n  - **Live Autonomous Stream**: Simulates and displays step-by-step agent thoughts with real terminal command executions, standard output logs, git diffs, and live status tags.\n  - **Click-to-Expand Accordion**: Easily collapse or expand any execution step to inspect the underlying model reasoning and terminal commands.\n  - **Network Egress Allowlist Inspector**: Dedicated table demonstrating allowlisted domains (such as PyPI\'s CDN `files.pythonhosted.org`, GitHub, and Google APIs) vs. unauthorized network endpoints with egress telemetry.\n  - **Mission Presets**: Includes the preset for *\"Audit this repository for competing identity authorities\"* as well as network allowlist verification and benchmarking missions.\n  - **Cost & Telemetry Benchmarker**: Side-by-side spec comparison between **Cloudflare Containers** (1/4 vCPU, 1 GiB RAM, sovereign baseline) and **Google Antigravity** (free remote sandbox compute during preview with Gemini 3.7 Flash token pricing breakdown).\n  - **System Architecture Visualizer**: Vector diagram mapping the Agent Gateway, Cloudflare Worker DO proxy, and execution engines.\n\n- **Seamless View Switcher**:\n  - Top header toggle to easily jump between **Browser Mode** (generative web browsing with native Text-to-Speech) and **AntiGravity Lane**.\n  - Direct quick-launch action buttons in both the Address Bar menu and the New Tab screen."
