  planner_response {
    response: "The updated **AgentSam Build Mode v0** architecture has been implemented, integrating Cloudflare\'s latest agentic stack alongside Google Antigravity benchmarking:\n\n### Architectural Highlights\n\n- **Dual-Backend Workspace (`@cloudflare/computer`)**:\n  - **SQLite-Backed Filesystem**: Instant workspace mounting with persistent virtual filesystem auditing.\n  - **Worker Isolate Router**: Ultra-fast execution for textual operations (`grep`, `cat`, `sed`, `jq`, file diffs).\n  - **Lazy Linux Container**: Reserved for heavy compute tasks (`npm test`, `vite build`, git operations).\n\n- **Cost-Optimized Model Ladder & AI Gateway**:\n  - **GLM-5.3 Flash** ($0.15/M input, $0.50/M output) configured as the default autonomous workhorse.\n  - **GLM-5.3** ($1.40/M input, $4.40/M output) available for escalation on complex reasoning steps.\n  - **Real-Time Spend Cap Meter**: Live tracking against a daily budget with token-by-token cost accounting.\n\n- **Code Mode Tool Composition Engine**:\n  - Compresses multi-tool inspection sequences (10+ separate round-trips) into a single programmatic AST script turn.\n\n- **Autonomous Browser Lane**:\n  - **Kitesurf**: Lightweight Worker-based agent browser for instant accessibility tree audits.\n  - **Browser Run (Chromium CDP)**: Pixel-perfect mobile viewport verification (390\303\227844) with automated safe-area inset checks.\n\n- **Vertical Slice Mission (`repair-mobile-chat-composer`)**:\n  - Simulates the full end-to-end engineering workflow: Code Mode discovery \342\206\222 3-file patch \342\206\222 container unit tests (18/18 pass) \342\206\222 bundle compilation \342\206\222 Kitesurf accessibility audit \342\206\222 Chromium visual verification \342\206\222 verified Git commit."
    modified_response: "The updated **AgentSam Build Mode v0** architecture has been implemented, integrating Cloudflare\'s latest agentic stack alongside Google Antigravity benchmarking:\n\n### Architectural Highlights\n\n- **Dual-Backend Workspace (`@cloudflare/computer`)**:\n  - **SQLite-Backed Filesystem**: Instant workspace mounting with persistent virtual filesystem auditing.\n  - **Worker Isolate Router**: Ultra-fast execution for textual operations (`grep`, `cat`, `sed`, `jq`, file diffs).\n  - **Lazy Linux Container**: Reserved for heavy compute tasks (`npm test`, `vite build`, git operations).\n\n- **Cost-Optimized Model Ladder & AI Gateway**:\n  - **GLM-5.3 Flash** ($0.15/M input, $0.50/M output) configured as the default autonomous workhorse.\n  - **GLM-5.3** ($1.40/M input, $4.40/M output) available for escalation on complex reasoning steps.\n  - **Real-Time Spend Cap Meter**: Live tracking against a daily budget with token-by-token cost accounting.\n\n- **Code Mode Tool Composition Engine**:\n  - Compresses multi-tool inspection sequences (10+ separate round-trips) into a single programmatic AST script turn.\n\n- **Autonomous Browser Lane**:\n  - **Kitesurf**: Lightweight Worker-based agent browser for instant accessibility tree audits.\n  - **Browser Run (Chromium CDP)**: Pixel-perfect mobile viewport verification (390\303\227844) with automated safe-area inset checks.\n\n- **Vertical Slice Mission (`repair-mobile-chat-composer`)**:\n  - Simulates the full end-to-end engineering workflow: Code Mode discovery \342\206\222 3-file patch \342\206\222 container unit tests (18/18 pass) \342\206\222 bundle compilation \342\206\222 Kitesurf accessibility audit \342\206\222 Chromium visual verification \342\206\222 verified Git commit."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
