  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Cloudflare Integration**\n\nI\'m now focused on integrating Cloudflare Bindings and a code editor into AgentSam/AgentSamRemix. The goal is production-quality functionality. The new tab in \"App Settings & Live Theme Engine\" seems the best place to host this. This will make it easier to manage all cloud functions in a single place.\n\n\n**Expanding Binding Options**\n\nI\'m expanding the binding capabilities significantly. I\'m adding comprehensive support for families like D1, KV, and R2, presented via compact rows with edit/remove options. A clean picker for adding bindings is also on the way. I am also working on Wrangler config import/export. Finally, I\'m integrating the Monaco Editor for enhanced code editing features, including theme compatibility, syntax highlighting, and shortcuts.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 612643588
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
