  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the **Cloudflare Bindings & Edge Runtime** settings surface and integrated a full **Monaco Code Workspace** across the application:\n\n- **Bindings & Runtime Surface**: Added a first-class **\"Bindings & Runtime\"** tab inside the existing App Settings modal. Supports all 13 Cloudflare binding families (D1 SQL Databases, KV Namespaces, R2 Buckets, Durable Objects, Workers AI, Browser Run, Vectorize, Queues, Workflows, Service Bindings, Analytics Engine, Environment Variables, and encrypted Vault Secrets).\n- **Two-Way Visual & Raw Sync**: Built progressive disclosure visual cards with inline parameter editing, secret masking/reveal controls, and status badges alongside a live **Monaco-powered `wrangler.jsonc` raw editor** with real-time bidirectional synchronization, JSONC comment handling, preset stack loaders, and export tools.\n- **Reusable Monaco Editor & Theme Inheritance**: Created custom Monaco editor and diff editor components that dynamically register and inherit all theme palettes and live accent overrides.\n- **Upgraded Code Workspace**: Integrated a multi-tab Monaco workspace inside the AgentSam environment featuring a searchable file explorer, file dirty indicators, split diff viewer, and in-isolate execution testing."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the **Cloudflare Bindings & Edge Runtime** settings surface and integrated a full **Monaco Code Workspace** across the application:\n\n- **Bindings & Runtime Surface**: Added a first-class **\"Bindings & Runtime\"** tab inside the existing App Settings modal. Supports all 13 Cloudflare binding families (D1 SQL Databases, KV Namespaces, R2 Buckets, Durable Objects, Workers AI, Browser Run, Vectorize, Queues, Workflows, Service Bindings, Analytics Engine, Environment Variables, and encrypted Vault Secrets).\n- **Two-Way Visual & Raw Sync**: Built progressive disclosure visual cards with inline parameter editing, secret masking/reveal controls, and status badges alongside a live **Monaco-powered `wrangler.jsonc` raw editor** with real-time bidirectional synchronization, JSONC comment handling, preset stack loaders, and export tools.\n- **Reusable Monaco Editor & Theme Inheritance**: Created custom Monaco editor and diff editor components that dynamically register and inherit all theme palettes and live accent overrides.\n- **Upgraded Code Workspace**: Integrated a multi-tab Monaco workspace inside the AgentSam environment featuring a searchable file explorer, file dirty indicators, split diff viewer, and in-isolate execution testing."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
