  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing WorkbenchApp**\n\nI\'m now diving into the development of the core Workbench Application Component, specifically `components/WorkbenchApp.tsx`. I\'ve begun to outline its initial integration points, specifically a full viewport layout. This will include a top navigation bar and a workspace selector, the first of which will integrate with the `SamPrimeaux/inneranimalmedia` repository.\n\n\n**Defining WorkbenchApp Components**\n\nI\'ve expanded the viewport layout definition to include more detail. The top navigation now incorporates execution environment switching, model selection (like GLM and Gemini tiers), IAM operator profiles, and logout features. I\'m also now thinking about primary navigation tabs for active missions, repository intelligence, the Monaco code workspace, and a browser verifier.\n\n\n"
