  planner_response {
    response: "I have transformed the application into the **Agent Sam Workbench**, establishing a complete, production-grade architecture that consumes the canonical `@inneranimalmedia/agentsam-sdk` contracts.\n\n### Key Capabilities & Architectural Foundations\n\n- **Canonical Agent Sam SDK Integration (`@inneranimalmedia/agentsam-sdk`)**:\n  - Built out the typed SDK modules covering **Identity & Session Management**, **Repository Intelligence Engine**, **Pluggable Execution Environments**, **First-Class Tool Registry**, **Mission Lifecycle Engine**, and **Higher-Order Code Mode Composition**.\n- **Real Identity Worker & Auth Boundary**:\n  - Implemented the full Worker authentication surface (`GET /api/auth/me`, `POST /api/auth/login`, `POST /api/auth/signup`, `POST /api/auth/logout`, and IAM OAuth / BYOK endpoints).\n  - Unauthenticated visits cleanly load the dedicated IAM single sign-on interface; authenticated sessions transition straight into the full-viewport workbench.\n- **Mission Runtime & Typed Event Ledger**:\n  - Realized the continuous mission loop (`inspect` \342\206\222 `reason` \342\206\222 `act` \342\206\222 `observe` \342\206\222 `adjust` \342\206\222 `verify`) through the full lifecycle states (`created`, `preparing`, `inspecting`, `planning`, `executing`, `verifying`, `review_ready`, `completed`).\n  - The Execution Ledger directly consumes typed SDK events (`environment.preparing`, `repository.search`, `tool.started`, `file.edited`, `terminal.completed`, `test.completed`, `browser.verified`, `mission.completed`), featuring compact rows by default with progressive disclosure on click.\n- **Repository Intelligence & Architectural Diagnostics**:\n  - Machine-readable AST and Git churn analysis via `sam.repository.inspect(repo)` capable of inspecting `SamPrimeaux/inneranimalmedia` and `SamPrimeaux/agentsam-sdk`.\n  - Surfaces health scores, language distribution, monorepo topology, God File candidates (e.g. `src/legacy/authManager.ts`), and duplicate authority signals with direct one-click refactoring mission launches.\n- **Recursive Self-Hosting Mode (\"Develop AgentSam\")**:\n  - Dedicated dogfooding studio targeting `SamPrimeaux/agentsam-sdk` in an isolated candidate workspace (SDK N+1).\n  - Enforces strict regression gates (typecheck, unit tests, integration tests, contract tests, secret scan, safety audit) and compiles structured **Evolution Reports** with before/after latency and memory benchmarks.\n- **Safety Interceptor & Code Mode Runner**:\n  - Interactive approval gates pause execution whenever a `WRITE`, `EXECUTE`, `DESTRUCTIVE`, or `EXTERNAL_EFFECT` tool call is requested.\n  - Programmatic batch execution via `runCode(async tools => ...)` eliminates model round-trip latency for multi-step filesystem and terminal actions."
    modified_response: "I have transformed the application into the **Agent Sam Workbench**, establishing a complete, production-grade architecture that consumes the canonical `@inneranimalmedia/agentsam-sdk` contracts.\n\n### Key Capabilities & Architectural Foundations\n\n- **Canonical Agent Sam SDK Integration (`@inneranimalmedia/agentsam-sdk`)**:\n  - Built out the typed SDK modules covering **Identity & Session Management**, **Repository Intelligence Engine**, **Pluggable Execution Environments**, **First-Class Tool Registry**, **Mission Lifecycle Engine**, and **Higher-Order Code Mode Composition**.\n- **Real Identity Worker & Auth Boundary**:\n  - Implemented the full Worker authentication surface (`GET /api/auth/me`, `POST /api/auth/login`, `POST /api/auth/signup`, `POST /api/auth/logout`, and IAM OAuth / BYOK endpoints).\n  - Unauthenticated visits cleanly load the dedicated IAM single sign-on interface; authenticated sessions transition straight into the full-viewport workbench.\n- **Mission Runtime & Typed Event Ledger**:\n  - Realized the continuous mission loop (`inspect` \342\206\222 `reason` \342\206\222 `act` \342\206\222 `observe` \342\206\222 `adjust` \342\206\222 `verify`) through the full lifecycle states (`created`, `preparing`, `inspecting`, `planning`, `executing`, `verifying`, `review_ready`, `completed`).\n  - The Execution Ledger directly consumes typed SDK events (`environment.preparing`, `repository.search`, `tool.started`, `file.edited`, `terminal.completed`, `test.completed`, `browser.verified`, `mission.completed`), featuring compact rows by default with progressive disclosure on click.\n- **Repository Intelligence & Architectural Diagnostics**:\n  - Machine-readable AST and Git churn analysis via `sam.repository.inspect(repo)` capable of inspecting `SamPrimeaux/inneranimalmedia` and `SamPrimeaux/agentsam-sdk`.\n  - Surfaces health scores, language distribution, monorepo topology, God File candidates (e.g. `src/legacy/authManager.ts`), and duplicate authority signals with direct one-click refactoring mission launches.\n- **Recursive Self-Hosting Mode (\"Develop AgentSam\")**:\n  - Dedicated dogfooding studio targeting `SamPrimeaux/agentsam-sdk` in an isolated candidate workspace (SDK N+1).\n  - Enforces strict regression gates (typecheck, unit tests, integration tests, contract tests, secret scan, safety audit) and compiles structured **Evolution Reports** with before/after latency and memory benchmarks.\n- **Safety Interceptor & Code Mode Runner**:\n  - Interactive approval gates pause execution whenever a `WRITE`, `EXECUTE`, `DESTRUCTIVE`, or `EXTERNAL_EFFECT` tool call is requested.\n  - Programmatic batch execution via `runCode(async tools => ...)` eliminates model round-trip latency for multi-step filesystem and terminal actions."
