    response: "I have diagnosed and resolved the deployment and build issues:\n\n- **Syntax Literal Parsing Fix**: Corrected unescaped single quotation marks within the sample SVG data string in `services/visionService.ts` that was breaking TypeScript compilation during the build phase.\n- **Express v5 Route Compatibility**: Updated the production SPA fallback route in `server.ts` to `app.get(\'*all\', ...)` to ensure seamless wildcard path resolution across Cloud Run production containers.\n- **Compilation Verification**: Ran full TypeScript checking and production bundle compilation (`vite build` and `esbuild server.ts`), confirming all build artifacts compile cleanly."
    modified_response: "I have diagnosed and resolved the deployment and build issues:\n\n- **Syntax Literal Parsing Fix**: Corrected unescaped single quotation marks within the sample SVG data string in `services/visionService.ts` that was breaking TypeScript compilation during the build phase.\n- **Express v5 Route Compatibility**: Updated the production SPA fallback route in `server.ts` to `app.get(\'*all\', ...)` to ensure seamless wildcard path resolution across Cloud Run production containers.\n- **Compilation Verification**: Ran full TypeScript checking and production bundle compilation (`vite build` and `esbuild server.ts`), confirming all build artifacts compile cleanly."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
